{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Managing Your VRChat Photos Easy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metamory is a photo management service that automatically syncs photos taken in VRChat, allowing you to view them on your smartphone and share them with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2460: Automatically Upload VRChat Photos!</strong><br>As soon as you take a photo in VRChat, it\u2019s automatically uploaded to Metamory!<br>You can view and share your photos from both your smartphone and PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2461: Share Without Using Your Real Name &amp; Store About One Year\u2019s Worth of Photos for Free!</strong><br>With Metamory, you can share photos using your usual VRChat username\u2014no need to use your real name!<br>You can also store up to 1,000 photos (about one year's worth) for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2462: Automatically Detect &amp; Tag People in Photos!</strong><br>Metamory automatically identifies and tags users who were in the same instance when a photo was taken.<br>You can search for photos by who appears in them, and easily look back on shared moments with friends!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684670?t=1773438751","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684670?t=1773438751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684670/8945d6f493d2e4d6fcbdc2b6eb56f3aacc519e57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773438751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684670/8945d6f493d2e4d6fcbdc2b6eb56f3aacc519e57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773438751","categories":[{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Managing Your VRChat Photos Easy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metamory is a photo management service that automatically syncs photos taken in VRChat, allowing you to view them on your smartphone and share them with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2460: Automatically Upload VRChat Photos!</strong><br>As soon as you take a photo in VRChat, it\u2019s automatically uploaded to Metamory!<br>You can view and share your photos from both your smartphone and PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2461: Share Without Using Your Real Name &amp; Store About One Year\u2019s Worth of Photos for Free!</strong><br>With Metamory, you can share photos using your usual VRChat username\u2014no need to use your real name!<br>You can also store up to 1,000 photos (about one year's worth) for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature \u2462: Automatically Detect &amp; Tag People in Photos!</strong><br>Metamory automatically identifies and tags users who were in the same instance when a photo was taken.<br>You can search for photos by who appears in them, and easily look back on shared moments with friends!</p>","developers":["Metamory"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Metamory Account ","genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684670/1f5da629b88d9287bb035e3ddddfbc92ac0ad898/header.jpg?t=1773438751","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3684670/624439992/c8cc1fd388a5b41e4168dbd1c4fcaa65de4d73a7/1750401686/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751869379","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/